---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="New Webcam Model Growth Program"
  description="A structured 30-day audience growth program for new webcam models. Build your first loyal viewers, learn platform best practices, and establish sustainable income."
>
  <article>
    <h1>New Model Growth Program</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      Starting from zero is the hardest part. Our structured program compresses months of trial-and-error into 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2>The Challenge for New Models</h2>
    <p>
      Every new model faces the same problem: cam platforms reward rooms that already have viewers.
      Without an initial audience, you're invisible. Without visibility, you can't get an audience.
      Breaking this cycle is the core challenge — and it's what our program is designed to solve.
    </p>

    <h2>What the 30-Day Program Includes</h2>

    <h3>Week 1 — Foundation</h3>
    <p>Profile audit and optimization, tag strategy, category selection, and first-impression review.
    We ensure that when someone does find you, they stay.</p>

    <h3>Week 2 — Schedule & Presence</h3>
    <p>Building a streaming schedule based on your target audience's active hours. Setting up
    off-platform presence (social accounts, community participation) that drives initial traffic.</p>

    <h3>Week 3 — Audience Activation</h3>
    <p>Strategies to convert first-time viewers into returning regulars. How to run your first stream
    in a way that builds loyalty. Understanding tipping culture and how to encourage it naturally.</p>

    <h3>Week 4 — Analytics & Iteration</h3>
    <p>Reviewing what worked, what didn't, and building your ongoing growth playbook for months 2 and beyond.</p>

    <h2>Expected Outcomes</h2>
    <p>Results vary by model, platform, and consistency, but models who follow the program typically see:</p>
    <ul style="margin: 1rem 0 1rem 1.5rem; color: #333;">
      <li>A consistent base of returning viewers by week 3</li>
      <li>A clear understanding of their best streaming times and audience</li>
      <li>An optimized profile that converts browsers to followers</li>
      <li>A repeatable system they can execute independently going forward</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Ready to Start?</h2>
    <p>Contact us to apply for the new model program. We review each application individually
    to ensure we can genuinely help before we take you on as a client.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
